  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 32 * 42 * 7 * 7 * 17 = 202 \n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the * signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ×, ÷, -, +\n\n32 * 42 * 7 * 7 * 17 = 202 ⇒ 32 × **42 ÷ 7**__ - 7 + 17 = 202 \n\n__**32 ×**____** **__**__6__** - 7 + 17 = 202\n\n__**192 + 17**__ - 7 = 202\n\n__**209 - 7**__ = 202\n\n**202 = 202 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ×, -, +, ÷ \n\n32 * 42 * 7 * 7 * 17 = 202 ⇒ 32 × 42 - 7 + **7 ÷ 17**__ = 202\n\n__**32 ×**____** 42**__ - 7 + 0.41 = 202\n\n__**1344 + 0.41**__ - 7 = 202\n\n__**1344.41 - 7**__ = 202\n\n1337.41 ≠ 202 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : +, ÷, ×, -\n\n32 * 42 * 7 * 7 * 17 = 202 ⇒ 32 + **42 ÷ 7**__ × 7 - 17 = 202\n\n32 + __**6 ×**____** 7**__ - 17 = 202\n\n__**32 + 42**__ - 17 = 202\n\n__**74 - 17**__ = 202\n\n57 ≠ 202 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : +, ×, ÷, -\n\n32 * 42 * 7 * 7 * 17 = 202 ⇒ 32 + 42 × **7 ÷ 7**__ - 17 = 202\n\n32 + __**42 **____**× 1**__ - 17 = 202\n\n__**32 + 42**__ - 17 = 202\n\n74 - 17 = 202\n\n57 ≠ 202 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
